HB0087 Consolidation of gaming.
Sponsored By: Joint Appropriations Committee
AN ACT relating to the administration of government; recreating, renumbering
and amending statutes to consolidate gaming regulation statutes; repealing
obsolete provisions; conforming provisions and references; providing for
application as specified; and providing for an effective date.
